# This repo is a REFERENCE PATTERN for hub-delivered adapters, so this file is deliberately short:
# every line either matches something this repo produces today or something a contributor will
# plausibly produce next. It replaced 195 lines inherited from interpretune, which in turn inherited
# them from Lightning -- Django, Flask, Scrapy, MNIST, wandb, `test_tube_*`, `docs/source/**` and a
# benchmark guard, none of which exist here. A template that ships another project's ignore rules
# teaches whoever copies it that ignore files are boilerplate to carry rather than state to maintain.
#
# Two of those inherited rules were worth removing rather than merely unused: `lib/` and `lib64/` are
# broad enough to swallow a real source directory, and they were only ever matching `build/lib/`, which
# `build/` already covers.

# Byte-compiled
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so

# Packaging and build output. `build/` matters more here than in most repos: setuptools does not prune
# it between builds, so a stale tree there can put a file in a wheel that no longer exists in source.
build/
dist/
sdist/
wheels/
.eggs/
*.egg
*.egg-info/

# Environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.python-version

# Tool caches
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# Coverage
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

# Notebooks. Nothing here yet; N5 adds the component example, and checkpoint dirs appear the moment
# anyone opens it.
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Secrets and per-machine state. `.env` carries live tokens on the maintainer's host and must never be
# committed; `CLAUDE.local.md` is the private instructions file the checked-in `CLAUDE.md` imports.
# `AGENTS.override.md` is its agent-neutral analog: a composed snapshot (AGENTS.md plus local
# files), not a reference, since it shadows AGENTS.md for Codex.
# `opencode.json[c]` carries host-absolute instruction paths (the harness homes), so it stays
# local-only: AGENTS.md loads natively and the shared instructions resolve via the homes
# without any project file. Kept on disk per checkout, never committed.
.env
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.override.md
opencode.json
opencode.jsonc
.claude/settings.local.json

# Editors and OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
